    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2019_0244","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Piotr Jovanović talks about drawing with a ladder. The interview stopped twice because the artist wanted to look at the corner of the room.</Description>
